# camp-save: load saved game A, make camp, view a character from the camp menu is not needed: save the game
# to slot B (S, then the slot letter) so the game writes SAVE\SAVGAMB.DAT and the character files, then press
# Enter on the camp menu, which asks whether to quit to DOS (the session ends there).
# The camp screen is animated: its keys are `press`.
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
key E
wait 100
press S                  # camp: Save
wait 150
press B                  # slot B
wait 300
press ENTER              # camp menu: Exit asks "Quit to DOS?"
wait 300
shot quit-prompt
